sequenceDiagram
  actor K as Klien
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as MySQL

  alt masih ada PENDING, belum hire
    K->>FE: Tutup lowongan
    FE->>API: POST /lowongan/:id/tutup
    API->>DB: PENDING jadi JOB_CLOSED
    API->>DB: jobs CANCELLED unlist
  else belum ada pelamar
    K->>FE: Hapus
    FE->>API: DELETE /lowongan/:id
    API->>DB: CANCELLED unlist
  else sudah ada sewa/hire
    API-->>FE: 400 terkunci
    FE-->>K: selesaikan pesanan dulu
  end
